        "TileImage": "$($repository c2c93fe4-3ae8-4598-b4e5-838c44ae86da).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon 47. Today&apos;s assignment is especially important, as it comes directly from the top brass of the ICA itself.\r\rYour target is a man by the name of Hektor Lindberg; A information broker who&apos;s had dealings with us in the past. Too ambitious for his own good, we believe Lindberg plans to sell off his knowledge to the Iranians, something we can&apos;t allow to happen. You will also need to deal with Lindberg&apos;s handler; Hasam Halim.\r\rA lot is riding on this, 47. I&apos;ll leave you to prepare.",
